# After S-944, Dict and Seq are plain VarRefs (Pattern::TypeAssertPending is deleted).
# Dict resolves to a TypeNode.Dict variant from prelude; Seq resolves to a function from prelude.
# Pin comparisons both fail (Dict([x:1]) != TypeNode.Dict variant, Dict([x:1]) != Seq function).
# The wildcard arm fires.
[match [x: 1]
    Dict:  "is-dict"
    Seq:   "is-seq"
    ...:   "other"]
=== out
String("other")
